    "message": "ci(test-slots): remove dead ci-ref lookup tag from build-and-deploy\n\nThe deploy-image resolver resolves CI images by the sha-\u003ccommit\u003e alias\n(glimmung#873, deployed) and reads only docker-build-check runs, so the ci-ref\nlookup tag build-and-deploy emitted on main builds was never read by anything\n(verified: no code consumers). Remove it and migrate the\ncheck-image-fingerprint-config guard to assert the ci-ref surface is gone —\ncompleting the end-to-end ci-* deletion for kill-me.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 \u003cnoreply@anthropic.com\u003e",
    "node_id": "C_kwDORV0mMdoAKDVmMmNiZWM1OTJhYmVmODUwM2YyMDBjYjNlNjJiZDZhZWI0NTRmY2Y",
